  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Aside from the provided image, I've encountered many cases where chatboxes are obscured by their own users avatars or even other users (this is most noticeable when the chatbox is set to 'Forward'). Giving chatboxes a higher priority in the render queue would be helpful, as it would prevent them from clipping into other objects by ensuring they render on top instead.",
